Subject:  [patch 101/178] mm/ioremap: rename ioremap_*_range to
 vmap_*_range
Message-ID: <20210430055823.25igSNQ7q%akpm@linux-foundation.org>
In-Reply-To: <20210429225251.02b6386d21b69255b4f6c163@linux-foundation.org>
